// Turns in degrees, the same for both sides (see src/character/animationDef.ts): arms and legs x
// forward and z out from the body; forearm x bends the elbow, shin -x the knee; spine, chest and
// head x lean forward, y turn to the body's right. `drop` lowers the body by a share of its leg.
// Kneeling to search: down on the right knee, the left foot planted, hands rummaging on the ground
// in front - a body, a chest, a bush - held until it is stopped.
